","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o162"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o015-wudi-p0318","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o015"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o160a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c5afdb2be643aab204a0","layer":"original","quote":"马超在汉阳〖6〗，复因羌胡为害〖7〗。氐王千万叛应超〖8〗，屯兴国〖9〗。使夏侯渊讨之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o162b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-7cda53694140f969edd1","layer":"original","quote":"韩遂徙金城，入氐王千万部，率羌胡万余骑与夏侯渊战。击，大破之，遂走西平〖3〗。渊与诸将攻兴国，屠之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗十八年：建安十八年（公元 213）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bec99dfe67d67ae54b06","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c4192d9fada3bef44302","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c4192d9fada3bef44302","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十九年：建安十九年（公元 214）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e80ed93e01a75d2ad2bd","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d44820525c4645832365","layer":"original","quote":"十八年春正月〖11〗，进军濡须口〖12〗；攻破权江西营，获权都督公孙阳〖13〗，乃引军还。诏书并十四州〖14〗，复为九州〖15〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o160","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c5afdb2be643aab204a0","layer":"original","quote":"马超在汉阳〖6〗，复因羌胡为害〖7〗。氐王千万叛应超〖8〗，屯兴国〖9〗。使夏侯渊讨之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o161","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ba55911420464ee82a49","layer":"original","quote":"十九年春正月〖1〗，始耕籍田〖2〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":280,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o162","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-7cda53694140f969edd1","layer":"original","quote":"南安赵衢、汉阳尹奉等，讨超，枭其妻子。超奔汉中。韩遂徙金城，入氐王千万部，率羌胡万余骑与夏侯渊战。击，大破之，遂走西平〖3〗。渊与诸将攻兴国，屠之。省安东、永阳郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-d8f5e2412a67fa02ccff","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-227735a113ee76b0c8ae","layer":"pei","quote":"千万西南入蜀，其部落不能去，皆降","attribution":"裴注·《魏略·西戎传》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":478,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-223c764a1a7d3577c3cb","start":170,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-e086535ba152e57316cf","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-227735a113ee76b0c8ae","layer":"pei","quote":"近去建安中，兴国氐王阿贵、（白项）〔百顷〕氐王千万，各有部落万余；至十六年，从马超为乱","attribution":"裴注·《魏略·西戎传》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":478,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-223c764a1a7d3577c3cb","start":111,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o015e-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b8c87841b07ea6980a4a","layer":"original","quote":"还略阳，进军围兴国。氐王千万，逃奔马超，余众降。转击高平屠各〖16〗，皆散走，收其粮谷牛马。乃假渊节。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":446,"end":497,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-b498a647e50cbea8388e","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b498a647e50cbea8388e","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗十九年：建安十九年（公元 214）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-046be76ee897a2f72015","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o015","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b8c87841b07ea6980a4a","layer":"original","quote":"十九年〖4〗，赵衢、尹奉等谋讨超，姜叙起兵卤城以应之〖5〗。衢等谲说超〖6〗，使出击叙；于后尽杀超妻子。超奔汉中，还围祁山，叙等急求救。诸将议者，欲须太祖节度〖7〗。渊曰：“公在邺，反复四千里；比报〖8〗，叙等必败，非救急也！”遂行。使张郃督步骑五千，在前从陈仓狭道入〖9〗；渊自督粮，在后。郃至渭水上，超将氐羌数千逆郃；未战，超走，郃进军收超军器械。渊到，诸县皆已降。韩遂在显亲〖10〗；渊欲袭取之，遂走。渊收遂军粮，追至略阳城，去遂二十余里。诸将欲攻之，或言当攻兴国氐。渊以为：“遂兵精，兴国城固；攻不可猝拔。不如击长离诸羌〖11〗。长离诸羌，多在遂军；必归救其家。若〔舍〕羌独守则孤〖12〗，救长离则官兵得与野战，可必虏也。”渊乃留督将守辎重，轻兵步骑到长离。攻烧羌屯，斩获甚众。诸羌在遂军者，各还种落〖13〗。遂果救长离，与渊军对阵。诸将见遂众，恶之〖14〗，欲结营作堑乃与战。渊曰：“我转斗千里，今复作营堑，则士众疲惫，不可久。贼虽众，易与耳〖15〗！”乃鼓之，大破遂军。得其旌麾，还略阳，进军围兴国。氐王千万，逃奔马超，余众降。转击高平屠各〖16〗，皆散走，收其粮谷牛马。乃假渊节。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":497,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
